# ==============================================================================
# BREWLY LOCAL TESTING & CREDENTIALS QUICK REFERENCE
# ==============================================================================
#
# 🔐 ADMIN DASHBOARD LOGIN:
#   URL: http://localhost:5173 (Click Shield Icon)
#   Username: admin (or admin@brewly.com)
#   Password: Set in server/.env -> ADMIN_PASS (Default local test: brewly123)
#   To reset/seed: cd server && npm run seed:admin
#
# 💳 STRIPE TEST PAYMENT CARDS (SANDBOX SAFE):
#   Card Number: 4242 4242 4242 4242
#   Expiration:  Any future month/year (e.g. 12/28)
#   CVC:         Any 3 digits (e.g. 123)
#   Postal Code: Any 5 digits (e.g. 10001 or 90210)
#
# (This .gitignore prevents your private keys and .env from being committed to git)
# ==============================================================================

# Dependencies
node_modules/
*/node_modules/

# Environment Variables & Secrets
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
*.env
server/.env
!server/.env.example
*credentials*.local*

# Build Outputs
dist/
client/dist/
build/
client/build/

# Logs & Debugging
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
*.log

# OS & Editor files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode/
.idea/
